    "description": "The Pharmacy Prescription Filling API enables healthcare providers and pharmacists to efficiently fill patient prescriptions within the pharmacy management system. This endpoint facilitates the submission of prescription fill requests, allowing for accurate tracking and fulfillment of medications. Typical consumers of this API include pharmacies, healthcare clinics, and electronic health record systems that manage patient medications. By streamlining the prescription filling process, this API enhances patient care and improves workflow efficiency in pharmacy operations.",
